like a real turtle, no buttons or joysticks required! Play on your own or join your fellow turtles in a public or private game. Enjoy anything from showing off your tricks on the diving board to exploring hidden treasures!\n\nThere are currently three unique game modes:\n\nTurtle Ball: An underwater game of two-team dodgeball. Hit turtles on the other team to switch them to your own team. Last team standing wins!\n\nZones: A game where turtles race to randomly safe zones that spawn randomly around the ocean. Anyone too slow will be frozen and can slow down unfrozen turtles.\n\nCasual: Hang out with other turtles with no rules!", "short_description": "Butterfly, backstroke, or freestyle! Swim around just like a real turtle, no buttons or joysticks required! Swim, race, and explore a variety of online game modes such as Turtle Ball and Zones!"}]}, "developer_name": "Sam Baker", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vRZ6WRuSkydWmWjnSH_ttrPy8Pfc38pH3io71892Yx0OAxIVu_UUdDMmJY1SmgyiGxPbcyYZKiaWJJp/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sam Baker", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@projectelectronics", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "CASUAL", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1127218841283151"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_imag